## PowerShell Activity Timeline

### SPL

```spl
index=* EventCode=4104
| timechart span=1h count as powershell_events
```

### Purpose

Provide visual identification of:

- PowerShell activity spikes
- Periods of elevated PowerShell usage
- Changes from normal activity patterns

PowerShell activity alone is not considered malicious.

