# Detection Telemetry Health

## SPL

```spl
index=* (EventCode=4624 OR EventCode=4625 OR EventCode=4104 OR EventCode=4698 OR EventCode=4728)
| stats latest(_time) as last_seen by EventCode
| eval telemetry=case(
EventCode=4624,"Windows Logon",
EventCode=4625,"Failed Authentication",
EventCode=4104,"PowerShell",
EventCode=4698,"Scheduled Task",
EventCode=4728,"Group Membership Change")
| eval age_hours=round((now()-last_seen)/3600,2)
| eval status=case(
age_hours<=24,"OBSERVED",
true(),"NOT RECENTLY OBSERVED")
| convert ctime(last_seen)
| table EventCode telemetry last_seen age_hours status
| sort EventCode
```

