# Limitations

## Event Presence vs. Sensor Health

If an EventCode is absent, the dashboard cannot always determine whether:

```text
No qualifying activity occurred
```

or:

```text
The telemetry source failed
```

without additional dedicated sensor-health monitoring.

---

## Detection Activity

Detection-relevant event counts are not alert counts.

---

## Historical Telemetry

Event IDs 4625 and 4698 have demonstrated inconsistent availability within the lab.

---

## Splunk Dependency

SOC-OPS-001 only evaluates data successfully ingested into Splunk.

It does not independently validate Windows audit policy, Sysmon configuration, or Splunk Forwarder configuration.

---

## Thresholds

Telemetry freshness thresholds are lab-defined and would require environment-specific tuning in a production SOC.

